+"""
+Safety ensemble microservice (production-grade scaffold).
+Combines:
+ - Detoxify for toxicity scoring (if available)
+ - transformer-based toxicity classifier (HuggingFace)
+ - PII detectors (regex + spaCy NER)
+ - factuality verifier (retrieval + entailment)
